      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: There are many ways to disable FBT. for example just turning a controller off will cause vrchat to enter 3PT because it is missing all the required trackers for 4/6PT. The steamvr menu is just the most common usage. \n\nI could have probably reworded the bug report by explaining that for any reason if vrchat is missing the required trackers to initiate the FBT calibration it will enter 3PT and this bug will occur. The steamvr example is an easy reproducible method.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5d7d4e2b3cb96d749aa716d9",
      "author": {
        "_id": "5ab3ad272b67505f726c2a8f",
