      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5d7ca342e33113611dac09b7",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Not sure it is vrchats fault here because as far as I am aware once you open the steamvr menu it stops sending tracker information. They do already recheck for FBT once an avatar reloads which is a decent fix for this.\n\nIf they were to completely fix this issue without allowing us to disable FBT in game, that would surely anger many users. Currently there is a decent middle ground where we have many ways to disable FBT if needed without restarting the game. An official implementation is still highly requested though so I would not be opposed to a fix if they also included a way to disable FBT.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
